  <name>cut2resolve</name>
  <summary>Lossless video editing with DaVinci Resolve marker export</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Fast, cross-platform lossless video and audio editing with a DaVinci Resolve marker workflow. cut2resolve uses FFmpeg for stream-copy operations and can export named source ranges as Resolve Media Pool duration markers without modifying source media.</p>
  </description>
